# ============================================================================
# annotate landing — Proof Sheet direction — HERO (16:9)
# Model: nano banana (gemini / gemini-2.5-flash-image) — pinned below.
# AI-GENERATED MEDIA: output must be disclosed as AI-generated when published
# (caption, alt text, or credits line).
# Run AFTER user approval: generate-media-prompt design/landing/prompts/proof-sheet/hero.media.prompt
# ============================================================================
schema: '0.4'

id: annotate-landing-proofsheet-hero
type: image
quality: high
service: gemini
model: gemini-2.5-flash-image

prompt:
  text: |
    Wide 16:9 illustration styled like a prepress proofing sheet on light proof
    paper (#F4F4F1). Center-left: a webpage proof laid flat, corner crop marks
    in gray (#B9BBB6) at its four corners and a tiny registration target
    (circle with crosshair) beside it. Page content is abstract: ink (#14161A)
    text bars and placeholder blocks, no readable words. One paragraph bar is
    marked with a precise proof-red (#E5484D) circle — drawn like a grease
    pencil on a proof, even and deliberate. Docked to the right edge of the
    proof: a clean white comment rail with three rounded cards (avatar dots,
    gray text bars) like attached correction flags; the middle card connects
    to the circled paragraph with a thin straight proof-red line. One small
    registration-blue (#2F6FED) margin note bar near the circled element, like
    a revision tag. Even flat studio lighting, near-zero shadows, everything
    aligned to a visible technical grid. Feels like page proof round two of a
    print job — precise, technical, calm.
  negative: readable text, letters, words, brand logos, watermarks, signatures,
    garbled glyphs, photorealistic humans, faces, CMYK color bars as decoration,
    halftone dots, dark background, neon colors, hand-drawn scribbles
  style: precise print-production illustration, technical grid, duotone
    blue/red accents on neutral paper, flat and even

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1280
    height: 720
    aspect_ratio: '16:9'

requirements:
  subject: webpage proof with crop marks, proof-red circle, and comment rail
  composition: proof center-left with crop marks, rail docked right, connector line, one blue tag
  palette: proof paper #F4F4F1 / ink #14161A / red #E5484D / blue #2F6FED / gray #B9BBB6
  do:
    - crop marks and one registration target
    - single red circle focal point
    - flat even lighting, technical alignment
  dont:
    - legible text or brand logo
    - decorative CMYK strip clutter
    - loose hand-drawn strokes

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.7
  required_pass:
    - composition
    - text_abstraction
  criteria:
    composition:
      weight: 3
      description: Proof with crop marks, red circle focal, rail docked right, connector line
      fail_signals:
        - crop marks missing
        - rail floating detached
        - off-grid placement
    text_abstraction:
      weight: 3
      description: Zero legible words, letters, or garbled glyphs
      fail_signals:
        - readable word or letterform
        - pseudo-text characters
    palette_fidelity:
      weight: 2
      description: Neutral paper + ink with disciplined blue/red duotone roles
      fail_signals:
        - rainbow or CMYK clutter
        - dark background
  reject_if:
    - embedded readable text, brand logo, or watermark
    - decorative clutter outweighing the page proof

tags:
  - marketing
  - landing-hero
  - annotate
  - ai-generated
product_targets: [annotate.therobotlives.com]
